{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/enriched(by:)"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination\/enriched(by:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination"]]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enriched","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enricher","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Destination","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"enricher","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What each record this destination receives adds to its context."}]}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A destination that hands this one each batch with its records enriched.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(","    to: ownBackend.enriched(by: Enricher { $0[RegionKey.self] = \"eu-west\" }),","    vendor",")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The enricher runs on each record of a batch as the delivery hands the batch to this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination, not on the tracker’s worker, so what it sets reaches this destination alone:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the others are handed the same records without it. It runs on every record the destination"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"receives, records a store recovered from an earlier run included, and reads any value it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"computes at delivery rather than when the event was tracked. So it suits values about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination or the delivery, such as a region or a deployment tag, rather than about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event: a recovered record would get this run’s app version and the network at upload time."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Like the other modifiers, the one applied last sees each record first: in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"destination.enriched(by: first).enriched(by: second)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"second"},{"type":"text","text":" runs, then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"first"},{"type":"text","text":", which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sees what "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"second"},{"type":"text","text":" set and has the last word on a key both set."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Records the enricher adds before a record, as ","type":"text"},{"code":"Enricher.sessions()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" adds ","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionStarted","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and ","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionEnded","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", are left out: they would reach the destination without passing the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s consent, samplers or store. Given such an enricher, this logs a warning once, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it is called. Give that kind of enricher to the tracker instead.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") enricher calls for a batch of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":" records."}]}],"style":"note","name":"Complexity"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"This destination, receiving each record with its context changed by ","type":"text"},{"code":"enricher","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enriched","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","text":"Destination","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"externalID":"s:12Destinations11DestinationPAAE8enriched2byQr6Events8EnricherV_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:12Destinations19InMemoryDestinationV","extendedModule":"Destinations","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"enriched(by:)","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"symbolKind":"method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Enriched.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/Enriched.swift#L34"}},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Enricher":{"type":"topic","title":"Enricher","url":"\/documentation\/events\/enricher","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Adds to the context of each event a tracker tracks, before the record is delivered.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/InMemoryDestination":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"InMemoryDestination"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination","role":"symbol","title":"InMemoryDestination","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"InMemoryDestination"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A destination that keeps the newest records it receives, in memory, for the app to read.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations":{"type":"topic","title":"Destinations","url":"\/documentation\/destinations","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Where tracked events go: the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Destination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" protocol, the modifiers that narrow what a destination receives, and the delivery that hands it batches.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/InMemoryDestination/enriched(by:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/enriched(by:)","role":"symbol","title":"enriched(by:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination\/enriched(by:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enriched","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Destination","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP"}],"abstract":[{"text":"This destination, receiving each record with its context changed by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enricher"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Destination":{"url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/destination","title":"Destination","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Destination","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Destination","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Where a delivery sends events: a plain sink that records the batches it receives.","type":"text"}]}}}